	name "Ace Combat 3 - Electrosphere (USA)"
	serial "SLUS-00972"
	description "Ace Combat 3 Electrosphere allow the player to pilot 22 aircraft across a series of 36 missions in Namco's third entry in its arcade-style flight combat series. Receive briefings before each mission to learn the battle details and identify your targets. Then pilot your aircraft around the battle area while attempting to destroy targets in the air, on the ground, or at sea. Complete your objectives to advance to the next mission with new aircraft and weapons."
