	description "Another in a long-running series of Contra games, C: The Contra Adventure takes place in the jungles of South America. A meteor from outer space has landed near a Mayan temple, killing hundreds of natives and destroying acres and acres of crops. The once placid temple is now occupied by aliens. Contra Force member Tanya has been sent in for advance intelligence, but she's missing in action. As Ray, former member of the elite Contra Force, you must come out of retirement and battle these forces alone."
