	serial "SLUS-00018"
	description "After establishing its reputation on the Sega Genesis (and cementing it with Super NES, 3DO and Game Boy versions), the Madden franchise makes its debut on the PlayStation with Madden NFL 97. Witness an attempt at broadcast quality presentation with video clips of John Madden, Pat Summerall and James Brown as you embark on a full NFL season -- including the playoffs, Super Bowl and even the Pro Bowl."
