game (
	name "Madden NFL 98 (USA)"
	serial "SLUS-00516"
	description "Madden Football has always been known as the pioneer of football games. Madden NFL 98 is as real as it gets to actually being a part of the NFL. Madden NFL 98 includes all licensed NFL teams and even has historical teams like the 1983 Raiders and 1985 Bears, and not to mention the All-Madden teams. It has all the NFL stadiums, the most current rosters, and every stat possible."
