	)
)

game (
	name "Madden NFL 2003 (USA)"
	serial "SLUS-01482"
	description "One of sports gaming's oldest and most respected series, Madden NFL returns to the PlayStation for another season of strategic play-calling, hard hits, and fast action. Title announcer John Madden is joined by longtime Monday Night Football anchor Al Michaels (who replaces the retiring Pat Summerall) to provide commentary from the booth. As usual, this PS version of Madden NFL 2003 features updated team uniforms, logos, stadiums, and rosters based on the most recent (2002) season. Teams have been organized according to the new NFL conference and division alignments, with the Houston Texans available for play in Exhibition, Season, and Franchise modes."
