game (
	name "Nascar 2001 (USA)"
	serial "SLUS-01263"
	description "This '2001' version of EA Sports' NASCAR is built on a new game engine, designed to produce improved environment mapping, real-time lighting effects, and realistic car physics. It is also the first NASCAR game to allow virtual drivers to race the quintessential Daytona 500. Over two dozen other ovals and road courses are available, as well, and the game features all 34 real-life drivers and teams from the most recent full season. Players can race through multiple seasons in the game, customizing their vehicles and building a reputation for precision driving at 200+ MPH."
