	name "Beat Planet Music (Japan)"
	serial "SCPS-18013"
	description "Beat Planet Music is, as the title would suggest, a rhythm action game. Each song represents a connection linking two cities; notes scroll down different lanes, and the the player must move their cursor from lane to lane and hit each note in order to play the music. As the player clears different songs, new samples are unlocked in the other mode: the song editor."
