	description "The original Blaster Master was released for the Nintendo Entertainment System while the sequel appeared on the Sega Genesis. Not including the Game Boy's Blaster Master Boy, Blaster Master: Blasting Again is the third in a series where players assume the role of Roddy, the son of the main character from the original. Roddy also drives the tank while jumping and shooting past enemies in a 3D underground environment. Players will also have to keep an eye out for switches and objects that allow them to open new areas of each level."
