	serial "SLPS-01557"
	description "Duke Nukem Total Meltdown features the full PC version of Duke Nukem 3D with all new weapon and enemy graphics and renders. Yes, everything else has been left intact (i.e. those infamous strip clubs and of course Duke's little catch-phrases) and uncensored. There's also six new PlayStation exclusive levels to wreak destructive havoc on. The game is also analog compatible and uses the Link Cable feature for a rough two player deathmatch."
