game (
	name "Eve - The Lost One (Japan) (Disc 1 of 4)"
	serial "SLPS-01805"
	description "This is a sequel to Eve burst error (that was only released in PC & Saturn). The events of Eve: The Lost One take place three years after those of the first game. You are able to control two characters - the female detective Kyoko and the mysterious Snake, as they try to solve a complex mystery full of betrayals and political intrigues. In order to complete the game successfully, you'll have to play it from the perspectives of both heroes, helping each other to gather clues and to unlock events."
	developer "C's Ware / Tose Software"
	publisher "Imadio (Imageneer)"
	releaseyear "1998"
	releasemonth "12"
	releaseday "23"
	users "1"
	genre "Adventure"
