game (
	name "FIFA '99 - European League Soccer (Japan)"
	serial "SLPS-02309"
	description "The FIFA series makes its fourth appearance on PlayStation with 250 club teams, 20 international stadiums, and 12 leagues from around the world. Lead your favorite team through a full season, compete in a European dream league, or create your own custom league and cup matches. On the pitch, your athletes will be able to perform new slide shots, traps, tackles, and acrobatic skill moves. View the action from a choice of eight camera angles, while carefully managing injuries, substitutions, formations, and fatigue throughout the course of play. Up to eight friends can compete simultaneously on the same screen with a Multi-Tap adaptor. A memory card is required to save statistics and season progress."
