game (
	name "Final Fantasy V (Japan)"
	serial "SCPS-45214"
	description "In Final Fantasy V, you control five characters who are trying to stop an ancient evil from returning to the world. At the start of the game the winds suddenly stop, leaving the lands mysteriously still. The king of Tycoon Castle decides to investigate the Wind Crystal (the world's source of wind) and disappears in the process. His daughter Reina sets out to find him but discovers a large meteor blocking her path. She then meets up with Bartz, a youth who lives his life as a traveler and adventurer, and Galuf, an old man who had been injured and has no memory of his past."
	developer "Squaresoft"
	publisher "Squaresoft"
	releaseyear "1998"
	releasemonth "3"
	releaseday "19"
	users "1"
	genre "Role-playing (RPG)"
