	description "Based on the short story 'Ghost Toilet' from Toru Tsunemitsu's urban myth collection 'School Ghost Stories.' This was adapted into the children's book 'Hanako in the Toilet: Scary Stories of Your School' (1993). Several artists then adapted this into the 'Here Comes Hanako' manga; most of them also wrote the anime version, which was aired as a segment of the TV series 'Ponkikki Kids.' Episodes, introduced by Hanako, included 'The Haunted Cinema' and 'The Cursed Promise Ring.' A 50-minute anime movie, 'Hanako of the Toilet' (1996), starred Hanako and was directed by Akitaro Daichi."
