game (
	name "Gate Keepers (Japan) (Disc 1 of 2)"
	serial "SLPS-02246"
	description "Gate Keepers is a Japanese manga series written by Hiroshi Yamaguchi and drawn by Keiji Gotoh in 1999. The manga was adapted into anime series produced by Gonzo, and first aired on April 3, 2000. The series was also produced into a role-playing game for PlayStation."
