	serial "SLPM-86999"
	description "Disney's Winnie the Pooh Preschool is an educational program for young children. Players will experience the Hundred Acre Wood and interact with Christopher Robin's friends. Activities include associating images in Pooh's house, number recognition with Rabbit, color recognition with Piglet, pattern recognition with Owl, sound matching with Tigger, and letter recognition with Kanga and Roo. Players will learn about friendship and helping others, receive progress reports, and work on phonics, thinking skills, sequencing, categorization, reasoning, and counting."
