	name "Koyasai - A sherd of youthful memories (Japan)"
	serial "SLPS-01775"
	description "Koyasai a sherd of youthful memories tells the story of a young boy in his last year of high school when he want to become the classroom king of the year (the most popular one). To become that he will have to win the election that will take place in the festival at the end of the year. He will also will gain their trust working with them in the different jobs to prepare the festival."
	developer "Astrovision"
	publisher "Shoeisha"
	releaseyear "1999"
