game (
	name "Myst (Japan)"
	serial "SLPS-00024"
	description "Had you known the consequences of picking up the mysterious old book, you would have never touched it. But you were curious; naïvely thinking this was an ordinary periodical. As you flip through the pages, the storyteller presents a beautiful image of perfect landscapes in a lush world. You are enthralled with a sense of immersion, as if the world is becoming real. Slowly, the real world dissolves and you find yourself standing on a pier facing an island."
