game (
	name "Parasite Eve 2 (Japan) (Disc 1 of 2)"
	serial "SCPS-45467"
	description "With a goal of fusing tension and drama found in movies with the game mechanics of the role-playing genre, the original Parasite Eve was Square's first attempt at creating a cinematic RPG; it was a commercial success, selling loads of copies to role-playing and survival horror fanatics. Because of the acclaim, the powerhouse development company did the only thing possible -- a sequel."
	developer "Squaresoft"
	publisher "Squaresoft"
	releaseyear "1999"
	releasemonth "12"
