game (
	name "007 - The World Is Not Enough (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-03134"
	description "Good afternoon, James. We hate to spoil your return with more bad news, but we have just received word that an MI-6 agent was killed in action before delivering a report from the Russian Atomic Energy Department. Our friend Sir Robert King purchased this report with the assumption that it would contain information on the attackers of his oil pipeline in Kazakhstan. Right now banker Lachaise has the money in Spain, so your mission is to meet him, find out who killed our agent, and return the money to King."
