game (
	name "Anna Kournikova's Smash Court Tennis (Europe)"
	serial "SCES-01833"
	description "Anna Kournikova's Smash Court Tennis is, not surprisingly, a tennis simulation featuring the beauty of the tennis scene: Anna Kournikova. Born in 1981 in Moscow, Anna's reputation went through the roof when she became the World Junior Champion at just the age of fourteen. Other credentials include semifinalist at Wimbledon in her debut for the tournament, Australian Open Doubles Champion in '99 and being rated in the top-ten women's single player in the world (to date as of 1999)."
