game (
	name "Breath of Fire III (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-01304"
	description "Ryu, a baby dinosaur, has just been discovered and rescued from his entrapment of ice. As you try to escape, the miners who found you capture you, put you in a cage and take you away on a train. Little do they know, Ryu's cage fell off the train into, what is for him, a brand new world. Ryu has also changed into a little human boy and he cannot remember who or what he once was. Upon finding him, two young misfits show pity on the quivering child and take him into their home. What lies ahead for our faithful protagonist? Only you can unlock Ryu's fate!"
