	serial "SLES-02117"
	description "Starsphere Interactive and Mindscape presents Chessmaster II for the PlayStation, the second edition of the popular original that many chess fans favored no matter what platform it was developed on. In this game you have a choice of 2D or 3D graphics with real-time board zoom and rotation, as well as twenty-four different chess sets, like Mycenae (Greek), Egyptian, Isle of Lewis, Staunton (classic), and many more! All pieces can be changed to a dozen types to your liking whether they be statues, thimbles, or just traditional chess pieces."
