game (
	name "Cool Boarders 3 (Europe)"
	serial "SCES-01615"
	description "This third release in Sony's Cool Boarders series returns gamers to the slopes for more big tricks and heated competitions. This release brings 34 new courses -- twice as many as the previous year's version -- and virtual boarders can show their stuff in six different events. Also new in this edition is the ability to punch rival boarders in the middle of a race. Strap on one of 22 authentic Burton or Ride brand boards and carve through the fresh powder of Cool Boarders 3."
	developer "Idol Minds"
	publisher "989 Studios"
