game (
	name "Critical Depth (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-00136"
	description "Developed by Singletrac, Critical Depth take players into unchartered territory. Featuring gameplay similar to that of Singletrac's previous shoot-em-up, Twisted Metal, Critical Depth allows players to venture into a vast number of levels and use an array of weapons to seek out a valuable artifact, the Threshold. Pick one of many different types of submarines, each with its own unique abilities and features, and go out into the wild blue yonder in search of the Threshhold. With a pumping soundtrack and killer gameplay, Critical Depth is a sure fire hit for gamers who are looking for an action-packed title that will deliver the goods."
	developer "Singletrac"
	publisher "GT Interactive"
	releaseyear "1997"
	releasemonth "12"
