	serial "SLES-02582"
	description "Crusaders of Might and Magic makes its PlayStation debut as an action role-playing game viewed from a perspective set behind the lead protagonist. You are cast in the role of Drake, a lone fighter who lost his family when he was just a boy. Known as the 'Scarred One' from the Book of Ages, Drake joins the elite High Guard on a crusade of justice and vengeance. Travel across five distinct lands while battling dwarves, giant ogres, and skeleton warriors. Your ultimate goal is to slay Necros, the dark lord of the undead."
