	serial "SLES-02864"
	description "Disney's Dinosaur covers the exploits of a dinosaur that managed to fall off the beaten path. It seems that as an egg, Aladar was stolen and then accidentally dropped onto an island populated by lemurs. The colony took in the little dinosaur and raised him as their own. Players will get to take Aladar and his friends, Zini and Flia, on a journey across 12 different stages."
