		name "Disney's Il Pianeta Del Tesoro (Europe).cue"
	)
)

game (
	name "Disney's Il Re Leone - La Grande Avventura Di Simba (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-03271"
	description "Before he can become the 'King of the Beasts,' Simba must first see the world through his own eyes and learn for himself what is noble and important in life. Guide him on his way through the jungles and plains in Disney's The Lion King: Simba's Mighty Adventure, staying always wary of hungry enemies and stampeding wildebeests. Plan carefully and react quickly to help Simba survive and take his place as the rightful heir to the mighty Mufasa's legacy."
	developer "Paradox Development"
	publisher "Activision"
	releaseyear "2000"
