	description "You are invited to join the characters Mulan and Mushu on the journey of their lives. Videogame publisher NewKidCo and Disney Interactive extend the magic of Disney's hit animated film Mulan to the PlayStation game console in Disney's Story Studio: Mulan. This action-adventure game leads girls on a daring quest in search of the elusive magic scrolls containing the legend of Mulan."
