game (
	name "Disney's Peter Pan - Adventures in Neverland (Europe)"
	serial "SCES-03707"
	description "Players take control of both Peter Pan and Tinkerbell in Disney's Peter Pan in Return to Never Land, a two-dimensional adventure for PlayStation. A treasure is hidden somewhere in Never Land and the despicable Captain Hook has shredded the map and thrown it away in hopes that Peter Pan will never find the treasure. As players explore the five regions of Never Land, they must search for the pieces of the map while avoiding enemies and traps."
