game (
	name "Final Fantasy IX (Europe) (Disc 1 of 4)"
	serial "SLES-02965"
	description "Corruption -- the root of all evil. Alexandria's Queen Brahne was once presented as a noble and caring ruler, who would throw lavish festivals to show appreciation for her supporters. Recently, she became involved in secretive deals with mysterious people. Matters took a turn for the worse when a renegade troupe kidnapped her daughter and changed the fate of a once peaceful world."
	developer "Squaresoft"
	publisher "Squaresoft"
	releaseyear "2001"
