game (
	name "Hellnight (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-01562"
	description "The futuristic Tokyo is a megapolis with a huge system of underground tunnels and sewers. A rumor is heard that in this underground world hide the followers of a mysterious cult, known as the Dark Messiah. You, the hero of the game, board a subway train, and after a strange incident followed by a crash, find yourself in the midst of the underground world. You have only one goal now - to survive."
