game (
	name "Hexen (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-00555"
	description "The sequel to the computer game Heretic continues the first-person fantasy combat that distinguished its predecessor. Instead of guiding a lone protagonist, you can now choose from three distinct characters: a fighter, cleric, or mage. Each character possesses special abilities and is individually rated in four attributes: speed, armor, magic, and strength. Characters can acquire up to four class-specific weapons to use against an assortment of evil creatures. In addition to the melee- and projectile-based combat, the game features several puzzles and traps to overcome or avoid."
	developer "Raven Software"
	publisher "GT Interactive Software"
	releaseyear "1997"
	releasemonth "3"
	releaseday "15"
	users "1"
