	serial "SCES-01000"
	description "Ever wanted to be a beach ball? References to Baywatch aside, this game is the most fun you'll ever have on a beach. Kula World puts you in the role of an inflatable beach ball, trapped in a never ending series of three-dimensional puzzles floating above the ancient Pyramids."
