game (
	name "Lethal Enforcers I & II (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-00542"
	description "Plug in a light gun and dispense justice in LETHAL ENFORCERS I & II. Lethal Enforcers I & II contains the Konami coin-op shooters Lethal Enforcers & Lethal Enforcers II: Gunfighters both on one disc. The games both share a similar gameplay structure with digitized enemy targets 'popping up' on screen and simply needing to be shot down before they take a shot at you.The original game places you as a 1990s police officer fighting bank robbers, Chinese Mafia and drug dealers while in the sequel you are now a Sheriff up against more bank robbers and wrong doing but now set in the Old West. Lethal Enforcers can be played with either a standard game pad or for more of an authentic arcade experience, the Konami Hyperblaster light gun."
