	description "Mary King's Riding Star is a fully interactive equestrian simulation. Players have the option to compete head to head against their friends or to compete against computer opponents in a 10-round Grand Prix season to become the champion. Players must keep their horse fed and well groomed and the stables clean in order to earn maximum points in each competition. Competing in dressage, show jumping, cross-country or in a complete three-day event, players are able to experience the thrill and excitement of an equestrian competition. Riding Star features superb graphics along with authentic commentary and scoring."
