	description "Select your favorite pro basketball team and compete in an exhibition game, practice session, or complete season with NBA Fastbreak '98. The game includes 29 NBA teams with an option to view the on-court action from 11 different camera angles. Lead your motion-captured athletes on a scoring spree with 27 offensive sets."
