game (
	name "NBA Jam T.E. (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-00068"
	description "NBA Jam T.E. features 2-on-2 fast-paced and unrealistic basketball. Following in the tradition of NBA Jam this game is filled with super dunks and has no out-of-bounds. Also featured are 9-point plays, rookie and all-star teams, injuries, and fatigue. A variety of power-ups allow: monster jams from anywhere, speed increase, power increase, unlimited turbo, increased 3-point ability, catch fire, and a bomb that flattens all of the other players."
	developer "Iguana Entertainment"
	publisher "Acclaim Entertainment"
