game (
	name "NBA Pro '99 (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-01970"
	description "Konami's fourth basketball game for the PlayStation brings together 29 NBA teams and over 300 authentic players with ratings based on the 1997-98 season. Added features include a 50-game schedule, NBA arena announcer Ray Clay, new motion-captured animations, and both three-point and slam dunk contests. As in previous games, the camera can be switched to different angles and zoomed in or out to offer multiple views of the court."
