	serial "SLES-03155"
	description "Featuring the 2000-2001 NHL season, EA Sports returns to the ice with the simulation hockey series, NHL 2001. As in previous editions, the game offers every NHL team (including the Columbus Blue Jackets and the Minnesota Wild), all players, and authentic stadiums. For the game's commentary, making a return in NHL 2001 are Jim Hughson and Bill Clement, who take care of the game's play-by-play and color commentary, respectively."
