	serial "SCES-00392"
	description "Play as any of the teams from the 1996-97 season in NHL FaceOff '97. If you're looking for a game that has just about all that hockey has to offer, you may have found it. Everything from the subtleties of both American and Canadian national anthems to the pain of plexi-glass slamming checks are in this game."
