	description "As you wake up from your slumber in a cryogenic tube, you begin to wonder who you are, where you are, and how you arrived at this unknown place. Thanks to the gadgetry surrounding you, the question concerning your identity is answered quickly: you are Raz Karcy. And with that helpful information you begin your quest to unlock your true past and discover why you are where you are."
