game (
	name "Patriotic Pinball (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-04092"
	description "Australian developer Wildfire Studios changes its focus from big acts like KISS and Austin Powers to American history in Patriotic Pinball. Two tables, Road Trip Coast to Coast and America on Duty, offer seven missions apiece. In the former, missions include rush hour at the Golden Gate Bridge, Muscle Beach, Route 66, Las Vegas, New York, gold mines, and whitewater rafting. The second table features the destruction of Confederate cannons in the Civil War, boot camp, tracking enemy subs, capturing Hill 142, saving the wounded from Heartbreak Ridge, flying a B17 bombing run, and helping Uncle Sam."
