		name "Reel Fishing (Europe).cue"
	)
)

game (
	name "Reel Fishing II (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-02780"
	description "Sparkling ocean waters and rolling streams surround you while your line is cast into the scenery, falling into the water filled with an assortment of fish to catch. This is the concept behind the popular Reel Fishing game for the PlayStation. The second edition of Reel Fishing builds on the original by adding more tackle, different types of fish and placing more of an emphasis on the types of fish you catch -- not the quantity."
	developer "Victor Interactive Software, Inc. / Team Craze"
