	description "It's been just days after the gruesome T-Virus disaster had finally ceased at the mansion's laboratory in the hills. Because of the revelations made on her journey, Jill Valentine resigned from S.T.A.R.S and attempted her escape from Raccoon City, now in shambles. But to her surprise, it was just the beginning in what seems to be a lose-lose situation after realizing her nightmares weren't over yet."
	developer "Capcom Production Studio 4"
	publisher "Eidos Interactive"
	releaseyear "2000"
	releasemonth "3"
	releaseday "17"
	users "1"
	genre "Survival Horror"
	rom (
		serial "SLES-02698"
		name "Resident Evil 3 - Nemesis (Europe).cue"
	)
)

game (
	name "Resident Evil Survivor (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-02732"
	description "Resident Evil Survivor is a spin-off of Capcom's survival horror series. Instead of giving players control of characters from a third-person perspective as in previous games, Resident Evil Survivor takes place from a first-person viewpoint. Originally conceived as a light-gun game (Capcom opted to take this feature out of the U.S. release, citing heightened tension over gun violence), it essentially plays like one. Players may rotate their view and move up and down hallways, but when the zombies come slouching, it will be time to let loose a hail of bullets to bring them down."
	developer "Nextech / Capcom Production Studio 3 / Tose Software"
	publisher "Eidos Interactive"
	releaseyear "2000"
	releasemonth "3"
	releaseday "31"
	users "1"
	genre "Survival Horror / Gun"
	rom (
		serial "SLES-02732"
		name "Resident Evil Survivor (Europe).cue"
	)
)

