	description "In the 1800s, young Johnny was in search of adventure. While investigating a series of mysterious disappearances near a local ravine, he was thrown from his horse by an unknown being. After quickly pulling out his six-shooter and firing a couple of rounds into the air, he was then rendered unconscious by the mysterious figure."
