	serial "SLES-01111"
	description "The Star Wars universe erupts into the 3D-fighting genre with Star Wars: Masters of Teräs Käsi. As part of his plan to crush the Rebel Alliance, Darth Vader has called upon Arden Lyn, a master of the fighting style known as teräs käsi. Her mission: destroy Luke Skywalker and his friends in a tournament-style competition spanning nine settings taken straight from the original trilogy of Star Wars films."
