	name "Star Wars - Rebel Assault II - The Hidden Empire (Europe) (Disc 1 of 2)"
	serial "SLES-00654"
	description "A long time ago in a galaxy far, far away, a Rebel pilot called Rookie One destroyed the Death Star, thwarting the plans of Darth Vader and the Empire against the Rebel Alliance. But Vader wants revenge. Since the crushing defeat, the Dark Lord of the Sith has had his engineers developing a new threat to the Alliance -- one that just might crush it once and for all."
