	description "3037. FedNet is now in control of the federation, and at an attempt to gain trust of the population following decades of corruption and warfare, the FedNet Space Corps were sent to the outermost planets to crush the small-time warlords still running the show there. After being 'convinced' to join them in a tour of duty, he is assigned to an elite flight group with the only purpose of testing the most cutting edge technology."
