	serial "SCES-01923"
	description "Team Buddies are heavily armed and ready for combat through more than 60 missions in eight Buddieland venues, including Central Park, Loon-A Moon, Rubber Jungle, Ori-Mental Peaks, Chilling Fields, Droopy Wood, Dirtbox Desert, and Insane Plains. Worlds are unlocked sequentially after mission-specific tasks are successfully performed. Depending on the mission and world, seven types of Buddies are available: Regular, Commando, Medic, Super Buddie, Karate, Stealth, and Cyborg, each with unique abilities and combat skills."
