		name "The Unholy War (Europe).cue"
	)
)

game (
	name "The Weakest Link (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-03551"
	description "The Weakest Link is an interactive adaptation of the NBC game show made famous by host Anne Robinson's cold, no-nonsense demeanor and catchphrase, 'You are the weakest link. Goodbye!' Robinson contributes to the game through video clips and voiceovers, while the actual gameplay is rendered using polygon graphics."
	developer "Traveller's Tales"
	publisher "Activision, Inc"
