game (
	name "Tommi Mäkinen Rally (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-01228"
	description "Tommi Makinen Rally joins Colin McRae Rally and V-Rally at the top of the simulation rally genre with some impressive features. For starters this game features an unbelievable one hundred and thirty plus tracks set right across the globe through rain, hail, snow, sunshine and heat waves. If that isn't enough, Europress have included a simple to use 3D Track Editor to make and edit tracks to your liking with a number of options."
