game (
	name "Yeh Yeh Tennis (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-02272"
	description "Yeh Yeh Tennis is an all-new tennis simulation from Sunsoft. The way the game is structured allows players to create their own players from scratch choosing not only the physical attributes of the players and their characteristic styles of play but also their temperament. So for example you could choose a left-handed smash and volley player with a fierce backhand and a fiery temperament who excels on clay. Or a defensive back-line player with a mean forehand drive and an attitude that is as cool as a cucumber and who perhaps favours the more traditional grass surface."
	developer "Sunsoft"
	publisher "Sunsoft"
	releaseyear "2000"
