	serial "SLES-04164"
	description "Yetisports (also known as Pingu Throw) is a web-based Flash game that originally appeared on the Internet in January 2004. The goal of the original game is to have a yeti smack a penguin with a club and try to get it fly as far as possible. The original Yetisports game features no name other than the words '1978 Reinhold + Yeti', a reference to Reinhold Messner's claim to have found Yetis."
