game (
	name "You don’t know Jack (Europe)"
	serial "SLES-03499"
	description "• You don’t Know Jack is not just another “Who wants to be a millionaire” clone,it’s a Party game! With over 800 questions in categories like “Shakespeare and provisional ice-hockey” , ”about gods, sovereigns and plasticine” and “Sex with Super heros” it guarantees multiplayer fun for hours. The categories seem to be random, but they’re always logical. And with the sassy comments of the moderator is even a wrong answer a occasion for joy, especially whens not your own."
	developer "Jellyvision"
	publisher "Take 2"
	releaseyear "2001"
	releasemonth "4"
